# TBCGuide - Night Elf start: Shadowglen and Teldrassil (1-11)
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide A_NightElf_Teldrassil
@name Shadowglen & Teldrassil
@faction Alliance
@races NightElf
@levels 1-11
@zone Teldrassil
@chapter Azeroth
@start
@desc Night elf starting route. Shadowglen to about level 5, then Dolanaar, the Ban'ethil Barrow Den, Lake Al'Ameth and the Oracle Glade. Ends with the flight to Auberdine for Darkshore.
@next A_Darkshore

accept 456 The Balance of Nature | Conservator Ilthalaine, in front of Aldrassil.
complete 456 The Balance of Nature | Young Nightsabers and Young Thistle Boars.
turnin 456 The Balance of Nature
accept 3116 Simple Sigil [class=Warrior] | Conservator Ilthalaine gives your class sigil now.
accept 3117 Etched Sigil [class=Hunter]
